# Edits to a migration that a release already shipped, accepted because they are safe for a site
# that ran the shipped version (a formatting change, or a fix that only matters where it failed).
#
# One per line: the blob the release shipped, then the path.
#
#   git rev-parse <release tag>:database/migrations/<file>
#
# A line stops matching once a release ships the edited file, and can be removed then.
